{"id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-substitution.md","title":"Substitution","display":"df-substitution — Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-substitution","aliases":["92-df-substitution"],"display":"df-substitution — Substitution","depends_on":["[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution — Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-substitution-—-Substitution-$\\varphit/x$\">df-substitution — Substitution <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span> (term set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,u,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(s,u,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (clause metavariables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G,\\mathrm{Subst}_G,\\mathrm{fresh}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G,\\mathrm{Subst}_G,\\mathrm{fresh}_G\\)</span> (definition-target functions)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Term}_G,\\qquad \\mathrm{Subst}_G:\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(x,t,x)=t,\\quad \\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(y,t,x)=y\\ (y\\neq x),\\quad \\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(0,t,x)=0,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(S(s),t,x)=S(\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s\\circ u,t,x)=\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)\\circ\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(u,t,x)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{+,\\cdot\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(s=u,t,x)=\\bigl(\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)=\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(u,t,x)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\neg\\varphi,t,x)=\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,t,x),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi\\circ\\psi,t,x)=\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,t,x)\\circ\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\psi,t,x)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(Qx\\,\\varphi,t,x)=Qx\\,\\varphi\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{fresh}_G(\\varphi,t,x,y)\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb{N}\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}},\\\\\n&amp;z_{\\varphi,t,x,y}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{fresh}_G(\\varphi,t,x,y),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(Qy\\,\\varphi,t,x)=Qz_{\\varphi,t,x,y}\\,\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\bigl(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,z_{\\varphi,t,x,y},y),t,x\\bigr)\n\\quad(y\\neq x,\\ Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Term}_G,\\qquad \\mathrm{Subst}_G:\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathrm{Term}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(x,t,x)=t,\\quad \\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(y,t,x)=y\\ (y\\neq x),\\quad \\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(0,t,x)=0,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(S(s),t,x)=S(\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s\\circ u,t,x)=\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)\\circ\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(u,t,x)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{+,\\cdot\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(s=u,t,x)=\\bigl(\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(s,t,x)=\\mathrm{SubTerm}_G(u,t,x)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\neg\\varphi,t,x)=\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,t,x),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi\\circ\\psi,t,x)=\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,t,x)\\circ\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\psi,t,x)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(Qx\\,\\varphi,t,x)=Qx\\,\\varphi\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{fresh}_G(\\varphi,t,x,y)\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb{N}\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\}},\\\\\n&amp;z_{\\varphi,t,x,y}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{fresh}_G(\\varphi,t,x,y),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Subst}_G(Qy\\,\\varphi,t,x)=Qz_{\\varphi,t,x,y}\\,\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\bigl(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,z_{\\varphi,t,x,y},y),t,x\\bigr)\n\\quad(y\\neq x,\\ Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span> : 将<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>中<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>的自由出现替换为项<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> : 自由变量函数</li>\n<li>替换只对自由变量进行</li>\n<li>新变量从不出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,t,x,y\">\\(\\varphi,t,x,y\\)</span> 的相关自由变量集合中；该集合有限而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> 无限，所以最小可用下标存在</li>\n<li>量词分支先作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-改名，再继续代入，因而不会捕获 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的自由变量</li>\n<li>对角化引理使用替换操作构造自引用句子</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-substitution-—-Substitution-$\\varphit/x$","text":"df-substitution — Substitution $\\varphi[t/x]$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-1","targetAn